    "text": {
     "en": "Handpicking separates large pieces by hand, such as stones from rice. Threshing separates grains from the stalks by beating them.\nChurning separates butter from curd or milk by spinning it fast. Magnetic separation uses a magnet to pull out iron pieces from a mixture.\nWe choose the method by the properties of the substances."
    }
